<section><div class="controls"><h2>02 / 存档概览</h2><select id="slot" aria-label="存档槽位"></select></div><div class="overview"><div><p id="summary"></p><p id="notice" class="muted"></p></div><img id="preview" alt="存档预览" hidden></div></section>
<form id="edit"><section id="stats"><h2>数值与容量</h2><div class="grid"><label>钱包<select id="wallet"></select></label><label>卢比<input id="rupees" type="number" min="0" required></label><label>生命上限<input id="maxHearts" type="number" min="3" max="20" step="1" required></label><label>当前生命<input id="hearts" type="number" min="0" step="0.25" required></label><label>魔力槽<select id="maxMagic"></select></label><label>当前魔力<input id="magic" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" required></label><label>瓶子数量<input id="bottles" type="number" min="0" max="5" step="1" required></label><label>语音语言<select id="language"></select></label></div><p class="muted">新增瓶子为空瓶，减少数量会移除末尾瓶子及内容物。容量选“自动”时，可按物品数量自动升级。</p><h3>袋子与箭袋</h3><div id="capacities" class="grid"></div><h3>物品数量与各区域钥匙</h3><div id="quantities" class="grid"></div></section>
<section id="items"><h2>物品栏</h2><p class="muted">移除默认保留获取记录。“清除获取标记”不会重置任务或剧情。武器和盾牌须先在两个时期卸下，默认服装不能移除。</p><div class="controls"><input id="itemSearch" type="search" placeholder="搜索物品名称或原始 ID" aria-label="搜索物品"><select id="itemFilter" aria-label="物品筛选"><option value="all">所有物品</option><option value="owned">已持有</option><option value="missing">可添加</option></select></div><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>物品 / 类别</th><th>持有数量</th><th>添加</th><th>移除</th><th>清除获取标记</th></tr></thead><tbody id="itemRows"></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="flags"><h2>进度标记</h2><p class="muted">高级操作：剧情与任务通常依赖多个标记，修改单个值不代表完成任务。标记名称保留游戏原始标识符。</p><input id="flagSearch" type="search" placeholder="搜索标记名称或哈希" aria-label="搜索标记"><p id="flagCount" class="muted"></p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>标记</th><th>补丁状态</th></tr></thead><tbody id="flagRows"></tbody></table></div><div class="controls"><button type="button" id="flagPrev">上一页</button><button type="button" id="flagNext">下一页</button></div></section>
<section><details><summary>字段查看器 · 只读</summary><div class="controls"><input id="fieldSearch" placeholder="名称、哈希或类型" aria-label="搜索字段"><button id="fieldFind" type="button">查询</button></div><p id="fieldCount"></p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>字段</th><th>哈希</th><th>类型</th><th>值</th></tr></thead><tbody id="fieldRows"></tbody></table></div><div class="controls"><button id="fieldPrev" type="button">上一页</button><button id="fieldNext" type="button">下一页</button></div></details></section>
<section id="export"><h2>03 / 导出旅程</h2><p>导出仅包含替换文件，不是完整备份。将 UTC 时间戳目录中的文件复制到备份副本的 files 目录；独立存档则复制到存档目录。如包含 manifest.json，将它放到备份根目录。</p><div class="controls"><button class="primary" id="download" type="submit">生成并下载 ZIP 补丁</button><button id="reset" type="button">重置修改</button></div><p id="result" role="status"></p></section></form></div></main><footer>基于 OOT SW2SE · 原作者 Traiver 及上游贡献者 · MIT License<br>本工具与 Nintendo 无关联。请勿上传不属于你的存档。</footer></body></html>
